«
@@ ============================================================
@@ WPDirect — "direct to": fly or steer straight from the present
@@ position to waypoint n of the route.
@@
@@ Input : φ λ n — present latitude and longitude (East positive), and
@@         the number of the waypoint to go to.
@@ The present position is inserted in the route before waypoint n,
@@ under the name "DCT", and the leg from it to waypoint n becomes the
@@ active leg (RouteLeg). The waypoints before it stay in the route.
@@ ============================================================

  → pp lp pos
  «
    "DCT" pp lp pos ⓁWPIns
    pos 'RouteLeg' STO
  »
»
